To join on multiple keys, the passed :class:`DataFrame` must have a :class:`MultiIndex`:

.. ipython:: python

   left = pd.DataFrame(
       {
           "A": ["A0", "A1", "A2", "A3"],
           "B": ["B0", "B1", "B2", "B3"],
           "key1": ["K0", "K0", "K1", "K2"],
           "key2": ["K0", "K1", "K0", "K1"],
       }
   )

   index = pd.MultiIndex.from_tuples(
       [("K0", "K0"), ("K1", "K0"), ("K2", "K0"), ("K2", "K1")]
   )
   right = pd.

